  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Seminarium om pensionsf&#xf6;rs&#xe4;kringssystem i Stockholm, mars 1998. Syftet&#xe4;r kunskapsutbyte men ocks&#xe5; att ta del av svenska erfarenheter. V&#xe4;rldsbanken &#xe4;r organisat&#xf6;r. Deltagande l&#xe4;nder &#xe4;r bl a Lettland, PolenUngern, Kazakstan och Slovenien.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support a seminar/workshop on Mandatory Funded Pension Systems to take place in Stockholm, March 1998. The World Bank is the organizer of the seminar. The objective of the seminar is to exchange views on mandatory pension system and different stages of reform. Participatingcountries are i.a. Latvia, Poland, Hungary, Kazakstan and Slovenia.</narrative>
  </description>
